 "welcome": "<div id=\"dp-wrapper\" class=\"dp-wrapper dp-hdg-brdr-h3-2 dp-hdg-i-bg-h3-dp-primary dp-hdg-i-styl-h3-pill dp-hdg-i-brdr-h3-0 dp-hdg-txt-h3-dp-primary dp-hdg-b-h3-brdr-b dp-hdg-i-sz-h3-in dp-hdg-padding-tblr dp-hdg-pt-h3-2 dp-hdg-ps dp-hdg-ps-h3-1 dp-hdg-b-h4-bold\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\" data-dp-fullscreen=\"true\" data-header-class=\"dp-header dp-header-pre-bg-dp-primary dp-header-s-brdr-t dp-header-brdr-w-2 dp-header-out-dp-primary dp-header-pre-font-sm dp-header-bg-dp-white dp-header-pre-pos-x-c dp-header-pre-pos-y-top-overlap dp-header-title-txt-mc py-2 dp-header-pre-s-rect dp-header-sub-bg-dp-white dp-header-sub-s-rect dp-header-sub-brdr-w-0 dp-header-desc-bg-dp-white dp-header-desc-s-rect dp-header-desc-out-dp-primary dp-header-desc-brdr-w-2 dp-header-wrap-s-rect dp-header-wrap-brdr-w-0 mb-0 dp-header-pre-brdr-w-0 cp-bg-dp-secondary\" data-nav-class=\"\" data-img-url=\"https://designtools.ciditools.com/css/images/banner_desert_sky.png\"><header class=\"dp-header dp-header-pre-bg-dp-primary dp-header-s-brdr-t dp-header-brdr-w-2 dp-header-out-dp-primary dp-header-pre-font-sm dp-header-bg-dp-white dp-header-pre-pos-x-c dp-header-pre-pos-y-top-overlap dp-header-title-txt-mc py-2 dp-header-pre-s-rect dp-header-sub-bg-dp-white dp-header-sub-s-rect dp-header-sub-brdr-w-0 dp-header-desc-bg-dp-white dp-header-desc-s-rect dp-header-desc-out-dp-primary dp-header-desc-brdr-w-2 dp-header-wrap-s-rect dp-header-wrap-brdr-w-0 mb-0 dp-header-pre-brdr-w-0 cp-bg-dp-secondary\">\n<h2 class=\"dp-heading cp-bg-dp-secondary dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-border-dir-none\" style=\"padding-bottom: 2px;\"><span class=\"dp-header-title cp-bg-dp-secondary dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-border-dir-none\">[Course Title]</span></h2>\n</header>\n<div class=\"dp-banner-image\"><img role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://files.ciditools.com/tamu/ModuleBannerTemplate_Meeting.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"843\" height=\"740\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<hr class=\"dp-hr-solid-light dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid cp-out-dp-primary dp-margin-direction-tblr\" style=\"border-top-width: 3px; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 5px;\"><br>\n<div class=\"dp-card card cp-bg-dp-secondary mx-auto d-block dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid text-start dp-shadow-b3\" style=\"border-color: #003c71; border-left-width: 4px; font-size: 16px; background-color: #732f2f; color: #ffffff; border-right-width: 4px;\">\n<div class=\"card-body dp-border-dir-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-border-style-none\" style=\"padding: 8px; border-right-width: 0px; background-color: #f7f7f7; color: #000000;\">\n<p class=\"card-text\" style=\"text-align: center; color: #003c71;\"><em class=\"\"><strong> Select each tab to review all the information on this page.</strong></em></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dp-panels-wrapper dp-panel-heading-text-start dp-tabs-buttons-vertical dp-panel-heading-p-1 dp-panel-color-dp-secondary dp-panel-active-color-dp-primary dp-panel-hover-color-dp-accent\">\n<div id=\"tab1\" class=\"dp-panel-group\">\n<h3 class=\"dp-panel-heading active\">Welcome</h3>\n<div class=\"dp-panel-content active\">\n<h4 id=\"tab1\" class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\"><i class=\"icon-home icon-Solid dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-none cp-out-dp-primary\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px;\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Welcome</strong></h4>\n<p><span class=\"dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr\">Welcome to the course!&nbsp;</span><span class=\"dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr\"><span>[Insert a customized welcome message.]</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr\"><span><strong>Video</strong>: Course Introduction</span></span></p>\n<p><span>[Insert the course introduction video here.]</span></p>\n<p><span><span class=\"dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr\">I encourage you to read the syllabus and explore the resources in this Canvas course. Please contact me if you have any questions. </span>Take some time to get to know the course and your instructor by selecting each tab. More detailed information about course topics, assignments, and the grading scheme can be found in the course syllabus.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"\"><span class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> <a class=\"btn dp-course-link btn-dp-primary cpv-bg-dp-primary cph-txt-dp-primary cph-out-dp-primary\" style=\"border-color: #ffffff;\" title=\"View Syllabus\" href=\"$CANVAS_COURSE_REFERENCE$/external_tools/2042\"><i class=\"icon-document\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i>View Syllabus</a> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span><em><strong>Click on the button below to go to the next tab.</strong> </em> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span><em><strong><a class=\"btn btn-dp-accent btn-sm dp-course-link cp-bg-dp-primary cph-txt-dp-primary cph-out-dp-primary\" style=\"border-color: #ffffff;\" href=\"#tab2\">Next Tab</a></strong></em></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"tab2\" class=\"dp-panel-group\">\n<h3 class=\"dp-panel-heading\">Instructor</h3>\n<div class=\"dp-panel-content\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<h4 id=\"tab2\" class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\"><i class=\"dp-icon icon-educators icon-Solid\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Instructor</strong></h4>\n<p><span>[Insert an introduction to the instructor. This might include information about why the instructor chose the field, their career path, or a bio. The instructor may consider adding a photo or video introduction in addition to, or in lieu of, a written introduction.]</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr\"><span><strong>Video</strong>: Instructor Video</span></span></p>\n<p><span>[Insert the instructor video here, if one was produced.]</span></p>\n<div class=\"dp-card card cp-bg-dp-gray dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid\" style=\"border-color: #003c71; background-color: #f7f7f7; color: #000000; border-left-width: 6px; border-right-width: 6px;\">\n<div class=\"card-body\" style=\"background-color: #f7f7f7; color: #000000;\">\n<div><span> <strong>Professor: [Insert name of instructor]&nbsp;</strong> </span></div>\n<div><span> <strong>Email</strong>: &nbsp;Contact me using the Canvas Inbox in the toolbar. [If the instructor prefers to use their email address instead, the statement may be removed and replaced with their email address.]</span></div>\n<div><span> <strong>Phone:&nbsp;</strong>[Insert phone number. If the instructor chooses not to list a phone number, this line should be deleted.]</span></div>\n<div><span> <strong>Virtual Office Hours</strong>: [Insert day and time.] Session information and links can be found via the&nbsp;<em>Zoom</em>&nbsp;tab in Course Navigation.</span></div>\n<div><hr class=\"dp-hr-solid-light\"></div>\n<div><span> <strong>Teaching Assistant:&nbsp;</strong>[Insert name of teaching assistant]</span></div>\n<div class=\"\"><span> <strong>Email:</strong>&nbsp;[insert email address used for TAs]</span></div>\n<div><span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> <strong>Virtual Office Hours:</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;[Insert day and time]</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span><em><strong>Click on the button below to go to the next tab.</strong> </em> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span><em><strong><a class=\"btn btn-dp-accent cph-bg-dp-gray btn-sm dp-course-link cp-bg-dp-primary\" href=\"#tab3\">Next Tab</a></strong></em></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"tab3\" class=\"dp-panel-group\">\n<h3 class=\"dp-panel-heading\">Course Information</h3>\n<div class=\"dp-panel-content\">\n<h4 class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\"><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-atlas\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Course Information</strong></h4>\n<p><span>[Insert the course description from the syllabus]</span></p>\n<div class=\"dp-column-container container-fluid\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"dp-card card dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid cp-bg-dp-primary cp-txt-dp-white h-100\" style=\"border-left-color: #500000; border-left-width: 1px;\">\n<h5 class=\"card-header dp-ignore-theme cp-bg-dp-primary\" style=\"background-color: #003c71; color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Course Learning Objectives</span></h5>\n<div class=\"card-body\" style=\"background-color: #e8e8e8; color: #000000;\">\n<p class=\"dp-heading-ignore\"><span>By the end of this course, you will be able to:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>[Learning Objective 1]&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span>[Learning Objective 2]</span></li>\n<li><span>[Learning Objective 3]</span></li>\n<li><span>[Learning Objective 4]</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"dp-card card cp-bg-dp-gray dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid h-100\" style=\"border-left-color: #500000; background-color: #bfbfbf; color: #000000; border-left-width: 1px;\">\n<h5 class=\"card-header dp-ignore-theme cp-bg-dp-primary\" style=\"background-color: #003c71; color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Assigned Materials</span></h5>\n<div class=\"card-body\" style=\"background-color: #e8e8e8; color: #000000;\">\n<p class=\"dp-heading-ignore\"><span>Materials for this course will include:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>[Textbook 1 in APA or MLA format]&nbsp;<strong>See the example below.&nbsp;</strong> </span></li>\n<li><span> <strong>Textbook</strong>: Author Last Name, F. (Year published).&nbsp;<em>Title of Work</em>. Publisher. ISBN-13: [insert number]&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span><em><strong>Click on the button below to go to the next tab.</strong> </em> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span><em><strong><a class=\"btn btn-dp-accent cph-bg-dp-gray btn-sm dp-course-link cp-bg-dp-primary\" href=\"#tab4\">Next Tab</a></strong></em></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"tab4\" class=\"dp-panel-group\">\n<h3 class=\"dp-panel-heading\">Course Structure</h3>\n<div class=\"dp-panel-content dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid\">\n<h4 class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\"><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-network-wired\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Course Organization</strong></h4>\n<p class=\"\">The course content is arranged into <strong>[eight]</strong> modules spread out across <strong>[eight weeks]</strong>. Although the presentation, media, and methods will vary from module to module, the navigational structure will remain the same throughout the course.</p>\n<div class=\"dp-card card mx-auto d-block dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid dp-shadow-b2 cp-bg-warning text-start\" style=\"border-color: #003c71; border-width: 3px 6px; font-size: 16px; background-color: #fff2cc; color: #000000;\">\n<div class=\"card-body cp-bg-dp-white dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid\" style=\"background-color: #f7f7f7; color: #000000; border-width: 0px;\">\n<p class=\"card-text\"><span data-teams=\"true\">Each week will begin on Monday and end on Sunday. However, module materials will be available beginning the preceding Saturday at 12:01 a.m. CT, giving you early access to the upcoming week\u2019s content. Unless otherwise stated, all activities and assignments will be due by 11:59 p.m. CT on Sunday, eight days after the module materials become available.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"card-text\"><span data-teams=\"true\"><br>*<strong>Instructional Designers:</strong> Be sure to review the program standards for Module opening day.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Each module contains a <strong>Learning Materials</strong> page that comprises an overview of the module topic and its learning objectives, the learning materials (readings, narrated presentations, interactive lessons, videos, or links to resources), and a to-do list of the requirements for completing the module. Please note that the learning materials may vary per module. Additionally, there is a <strong>Learning Activities</strong> section, which may include assignments, discussions, reflections, and quizzes; module assignments may vary from week to week.</span></p>\n<p class=\"\">A schedule of all graded assignments is available on the Syllabus link from our course home page. The syllabus is also available through a button in the Welcome tab of this page.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; margin-top: 12px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span><em><strong>Click on the button below to go to the next tab.</strong></em></span></p>\n<a class=\"btn btn-dp-accent cph-bg-dp-gray btn-sm dp-course-link cp-bg-dp-primary float-end ms-3 mb-3\" href=\"#tab5\">Next Tab</a>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"tab5\" class=\"dp-panel-group\">\n<h3 class=\"dp-panel-heading\">Expectations</h3>\n<div class=\"dp-panel-content\">\n<h4 class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\"><i class=\"dp-icon icon-standards icon-Solid\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Expectations</strong></h4>\n<p><span>To fully benefit from this course and have a great learning experience, a few expectations will guide our work together.</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\">Select each tab to learn more about learner and instructor expectations for this course.&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<div class=\"dp-panels-wrapper cp-out-dark dp-border-dir-none dp-panel-hover-color-dp-gray dp-tabs-pills dp-panel-color-primary\" style=\"border-width: 1px; border-radius: 5px;\">\n<div class=\"dp-panel-group dp-border-dir-all dp-border-style-solid cp-out-dark\" style=\"border-width: 1px; border-radius: 5px;\">\n<h5 class=\"dp-panel-heading\" style=\"background-color: #003c71; color: #ffffff; border-color: #003c71;\">Learner Experience</h5>\n<div class=\"dp-panel-content\">\n<p><strong>To be successful in this course, it is recommended that you:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Review the course schedule outlined in the syllabus and take note of when each of the assignments is due.</li>\n<li>Review the Canvas calendar to keep track of all of your courses and plan accordingly. Each module will have a to-do list on the module overview page, but you are responsible for keeping track of due dates.</li>\n<li>Complete and submit all learning activities by their due dates.</li>\n<li>Complete each module in the order in which materials and activities are presented.</li>\n<li>Login throughout the week. Your participation is essential. It might not be possible to fulfill the participation requirements for this course by completing all of your work for the week in one day. You must plan your schedule in a manner that allows you to remain actively engaged in each lesson.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dp-panel-group\">\n<h5 class=\"dp-panel-heading\" style=\"background-color: #003c71; color: #ffffff; border-color: #003c71;\">Instructor Experience</h5>\n<div class=\"dp-panel-content\">\n<p class=\"dp-heading-ignore\"><strong>You can expect that the instructors will:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Post weekly announcements outlining assignments and course expectations.</span></li>\n<li><span>Monitor course interactions in discussion boards, group work, and activities requiring you to collaborate with others.</span></li>\n<li><span>Check their email throughout the workday and reply to email messages within 2 business days.</span></li>\n<li><span>Provide feedback for all graded assignments.</span></li>\n<li><span>Assignments will be graded within one week (minimum) or two weeks (maximum) after the assignment's due date.</span></li>\n<li><span>Communicate in advance when there is a change in the schedule of the course.&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong><span><em>You have finished reading all of the tabs. Click Next below to progress through the course.</em></span></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
 "gsIntroFirst": "<div class=\"dp-wrapper dp-hdg-brdr-h3-2 dp-hdg-i-bg-h3-dp-primary dp-hdg-i-styl-h3-pill dp-hdg-i-brdr-h3-0 dp-hdg-txt-h3-dp-primary dp-hdg-b-h3-brdr-b dp-hdg-i-sz-h3-in dp-hdg-padding-tblr dp-hdg-pt-h3-2 dp-hdg-ps dp-hdg-ps-h3-1 dp-hdg-b-h4-bold\" data-dp-fullscreen=\"true\" data-header-class=\"dp-header dp-header-pre-bg-dp-primary dp-header-s-brdr-t dp-header-brdr-w-2 dp-header-out-dp-primary dp-header-pre-font-sm dp-header-bg-dp-white dp-header-pre-pos-x-c dp-header-pre-pos-y-top-overlap dp-header-title-txt-mc py-2 dp-header-pre-s-rect dp-header-sub-bg-dp-white dp-header-sub-s-rect dp-header-sub-brdr-w-0 dp-header-desc-bg-dp-white dp-header-desc-s-rect dp-header-desc-out-dp-primary dp-header-desc-brdr-w-2 dp-header-wrap-s-rect dp-header-wrap-brdr-w-0 mb-0 dp-header-pre-brdr-w-0 cp-bg-dp-secondary\" data-nav-class=\"\n&nbsp;\n\" data-img-url=\"https://designtools.ciditools.com/css/images/banner_desert_sky.png\"><header class=\"dp-header dp-header-pre-bg-dp-primary dp-header-s-brdr-t dp-header-brdr-w-2 dp-header-out-dp-primary dp-header-pre-font-sm dp-header-bg-dp-white dp-header-pre-pos-x-c dp-header-pre-pos-y-top-overlap dp-header-title-txt-mc py-2 dp-header-pre-s-rect dp-header-sub-bg-dp-white dp-header-sub-s-rect dp-header-sub-brdr-w-0 dp-header-desc-bg-dp-white dp-header-desc-s-rect dp-header-desc-out-dp-primary dp-header-desc-brdr-w-2 dp-header-wrap-s-rect dp-header-wrap-brdr-w-0 mb-0 dp-header-pre-brdr-w-0 cp-bg-dp-secondary\">\n<h2 class=\"dp-heading cp-bg-dp-secondary dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr\" style=\"padding-bottom: 2px;\"><span class=\"dp-header-title cp-bg-dp-secondary\">Class Introduction</span></h2>\n</header><hr class=\"dp-hr-solid-light dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid cp-out-dp-primary dp-margin-direction-tblr\" style=\"border-top-width: 3px; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n<div class=\"dp-banner-image\"><img role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://files.ciditools.com/tamu/ModuleBannerTemplate_Meeting.jpg\" alt=\"Meeting\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<hr class=\"dp-hr-solid-light dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid cp-out-dp-primary dp-margin-direction-tblr\" style=\"border-top-width: 3px; margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n<div class=\"dp-card card cp-bg-dp-secondary mx-auto d-block dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid text-start dp-shadow-b3\" style=\"border-color: #003c71; border-left-width: 9px; font-size: 16px; background-color: #f7f7f7; color: #003c71; border-right-width: 9px;\">\n<div class=\"card-body dp-border-dir-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-border-style-none\" style=\"padding: 8px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-color: #f7f7f7;\">\n<p class=\"card-text\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-info-circle \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> &nbsp;This is an individual assignment.</strong></em></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"#tab1\" class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\"><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-info-circle \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong class=\"\">Overview</strong></h3>\n<p>Before you launch into the curriculum for this course, we want to get to know you! We aim to create a collaborative environment where we can learn and explore course content and materials together. This class introduction assignment will allow you to get acquainted with others in class and become more familiar with the features of Canvas discussions.</p>\n<h3 id=\"#tab1\" class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\"><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-compass\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Guidelines</strong></h3>\nIntroduce yourself to the class and consider addressing some of the following ideas in your post:\n<ul>\n<li>Preferred name(s)</li>\n<li>What you hope to gain from taking this course</li>\n<li>Just for fun\n<ul>\n<li>Two truths and a lie</li>\n<li>Fun fact: achievements, passion, hobbies</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><i class=\"dp-icon far fa-comment-dots cp-out-dp-primary cp-txt-dp-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> &nbsp;<span style=\"color: #500000;\"><strong>Initial Post and Comments</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Submit a substantive reply to the topic above. This post is due <strong>Wednesday</strong> at <strong>11:59 p.m. CT</strong>.</li>\n<li>Provide additional responses to at least two classmates' posts (i.e., reflect on their response, ask questions, etc.). These are due <strong>Sunday</strong> at <strong>11:59 p.m. CT</strong>.</li>\n<li>Remember to be respectful of others' opinions.</li>\n<li>All comments must adhere to the <a style=\"color: #500000; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://aggiehonor.tamu.edu/rules-procedures/sr20.html#2012-honor-system\" target=\"_blank\">Aggie Honor Code</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-paper-plane cp-txt-dp-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <span style=\"color: #500000;\"><strong>Submission</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #333333; font-size: 15px; font-family: inherit;\">Click on \"Reply\" below and post your initial reply to the topic.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6;\">Respond to your classmates' posts by clicking on \"Reply\" below their initial post.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"#tab1\" class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\"><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-clipboard-list \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Rubrics</strong></h3>\n<p>To view the rubric for this discussion, click on the <strong>Options Button</strong> (three dots located at the top-right side of the page) and select <strong>Show Rubric</strong>.</p>\n<h3 id=\"#tab1\" class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\"><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-headset \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Technical Support</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;Need help using Canvas Discussions? If so, please review the following guide:</p>\n<p><a class=\"external dp-external-link\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #500000; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 25px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px;\" href=\"https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661284-how-do-i-view-discussions-as-a-student\" target=\"_blank\"> <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" style=\"margin-right: 8px;\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i>Canvas Student Guide - Discussions</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong><em>Click Next (below) to progress through the course.</em></strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"width: 100%; min-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/prod.files.ciditools.com/tamu/Banners_Footer/Banners_Footer/Footer.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n</div>",
