px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n<div class=\"dp-card card cp-bg-dp-secondary mx-auto d-block dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid text-start dp-shadow-b3\" style=\"border-color: #003c71; border-left-width: 9px; font-size: 16px; background-color: #f7f7f7; color: #003c71; border-right-width: 9px;\">\n<div class=\"card-body dp-border-dir-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-border-style-none\" style=\"padding: 8px; border-right-width: 0px;\">\n<p class=\"card-text\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #003c71;\"><em><strong><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-info-circle \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> &nbsp;This is an individual assignment.</strong></em></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"#tab1\" class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\" style=\"color: #000000;\"><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-info-circle \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Overview</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"color: #000000;\">Before you launch into the curriculum for this course, we want to get to know you better as a professional! We aim to create a collaborative environment where we can learn and explore course content and materials together. This class introduction assignment will allow you to get acquainted with others in class and become more familiar with the features of Canvas discussions.</p>\n<h3 id=\"#tab1\" class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\" style=\"color: #000000;\"><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-compass\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Guidelines</strong></h3>\n<p>[Insert a discussion prompt and any related links to articles, websites, or videos.]</p>\n<p><i class=\"dp-icon far fa-comment-dots cp-out-dp-primary cp-txt-dp-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <span style=\"color: #500000;\"><strong>Initial Post and Comments</strong></span></p>\n<ul style=\"color: #000000;\">\n<li>Submit a substantive post in response to the prompt above. This post is due <strong>Wednesday</strong> at <strong>11:59 p.m. CT</strong>.</li>\n<li>Reply to at least two classmates' posts (i.e., reflect on their response, ask questions, etc.). These are due <strong>Sunday</strong> at <strong>11:59 p.m. CT</strong>.</li>\n<li>Remember to be respectful of others' opinions.</li>\n<li>All comments must adhere to the <a style=\"color: #500000; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://aggiehonor.tamu.edu/rules-procedures/sr20.html#2012-honor-system\" target=\"_blank\">Aggie Honor Code</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-paper-plane cp-txt-dp-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong><span style=\"color: #500000;\">Submission</span></strong></p>\n<ul style=\"color: #000000;\">\n<li><span style=\"color: #333333; font-size: 15px; font-family: inherit;\">Click on \"Reply\" below and post your initial response.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6;\">Respond to your classmates' posts by clicking on \"Reply\" below their initial post.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"#tab1\" class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\"><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-clipboard-list \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content d-none\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Rubrics</strong></h3>\n<p>To view the rubric for this discussion, click on the <strong>Options Button</strong> (three dots located at the top-right side of the page) and select <strong>Show Rubric</strong>.</p>\n<h3 id=\"#tab1\" class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\" style=\"color: #000000;\"><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-headset \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Technical Support</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"color: #000000;\">&nbsp;Need help using Canvas Discussions? If so, please review the following guide:</p>\n<p style=\"color: #000000;\"><a class=\"external dp-external-link\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #500000; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 25px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px;\" href=\"https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661284-how-do-i-view-discussions-as-a-student\" target=\"_blank\"> <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" style=\"margin-right: 8px;\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i>Canvas Student Guide - Discussions</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong><em>Click Next (below) to progress through the course.</em></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color: #000000;\"><img style=\"width: 100%; min-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/prod.files.ciditools.com/tamu/Banners_Footer/Banners_Footer/Footer.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n</div>",
