e-solid cp-out-dp-primary dp-margin-direction-tblr\" style=\"border-top-width: 3px; margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n<div class=\"dp-card card cp-bg-dp-secondary mx-auto d-block dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid text-start dp-shadow-b3\" style=\"border-color: #003c71; border-left-width: 9px; font-size: 16px; background-color: #fff9e6; color: #000000; border-right-width: 9px;\">\n<div class=\"card-body dp-border-dir-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-border-style-none\" style=\"padding: 8px; border-right-width: 0px; background-color: #f7f7f7; color: #000000; border-color: #003c71;\">\n<p class=\"card-text\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong style=\"color: #003c71;\"><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-info-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content d-none\">&nbsp;</span></i> &nbsp;This is an optional space to interact with your peers!</strong></em></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"#tab1\" class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-info-circle\" style=\"background-color: #500000; color: #ffffff;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><br><span class=\"dp-icon-content d-none\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Overview</strong></h3>\n<p><span>This discussion forum is a space for you to use throughout the course to ask specific questions about the learning materials or learning activities. </span></p>\n<h3 id=\"#tab1\" class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\"><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-compass\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content d-none\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Guidelines</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span>There are no limits to posts. You can make as many posts as necessary.</span></li>\n<li><span>Share links and images that accurately capture your concerns.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #bfedd2;\">Please DO NOT post private messages here;&nbsp;private messages concerning grades, accommodations, and other academic needs should be sent to the instructor using the&nbsp;<strong>INBOX</strong>&nbsp;feature located on the maroon global navigation bar on the left.</span></li>\n<li><span>If you have an explanation or insight to a question asked in this space, feel free to respond; p</span><span>rovide evidence for the feedback you provide.</span></li>\n<li><span>Remember to be respectful of others' opinions and comments.&nbsp;</span><strong></strong></li>\n<li>All comments must adhere to the<span>&nbsp;</span><a class=\"inline_disabled dp-ext-ignore\" href=\"https://aggiehonor.tamu.edu/rules-procedures/sr20.html#2012-honor-system\" target=\"_blank\">Aggie Honor Code</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-paper-plane cp-txt-dp-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong><span style=\"color: #500000;\">Submission</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #333333; font-size: 15px; font-family: inherit;\">Click on \"Reply\" below and post your initial response.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6;\">Respond to your classmates' posts by clicking on \"Reply\" below their initial post.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"#tab1\" class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\"><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-headset \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content d-none\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Technical Support</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;Need help using Canvas Discussions? If so, please review the following guide:</p>\n<p><a class=\"external dp-external-link\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #500000; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 25px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px;\" href=\"https://community.instructure.com/en/kb/articles/661284-how-do-i-view-discussions-as-a-student\" target=\"_blank\"> <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" style=\"margin-right: 8px;\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i>Canvas Student Guide - Discussions</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong><em>Click Next below to progress through the course.</em></strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"width: 100%; min-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/prod.files.ciditools.com/tamu/Banners_Footer/Banners_Footer/Footer.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n</div>",
