">\n<h3 id=\"tab1\" class=\"paragraph ng-attr-widget dp-has-icon\"><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-info-circle \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> <strong>Overview</strong></h3>\n<p><span>This quiz consists of <strong>5</strong></span><strong>&nbsp;questions</strong><span>. To be successful in this quiz, thoroughly read the course syllabus, paying particular attention to course learning objectives, assigned readings, assignment due dates, and policies governing attendance, engagement, academic integrity, and grading.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<div class=\"dp-card card cp-bg-dp-secondary mx-auto d-block dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid text-start dp-shadow-b3\" style=\"border-color: #003c71; border-left-width: 9px; font-size: 16px; background-color: #f7f7f7; color: #000000; border-right-width: 9px;\">\n<div class=\"card-body dp-border-dir-tblr dp-margin-direction-tblr dp-padding-direction-tblr dp-border-style-none\" style=\"padding: 8px; border-right-width: 0px; background-color: #f7f7f7; color: #000000;\">\n<p class=\"card-text\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong><i class=\"dp-icon fas fa-info-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i>&nbsp; <span style=\"color: #003c71;\">This quiz is open-text; you are welcome to use the syllabus.</span></strong></em></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dp-card card cp-bg-dp-gray dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid\" style=\"border-color: #003c71; background-color: #f7f7f7; color: #000000; border-left-width: 6px; border-right-width: 6px;\">\n<div class=\"card-body\" style=\"background-color: #f7f7f7; color: #000000;\">\n<p class=\"dp-has-icon\"><i class=\"icon-note-light icon-Solid\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> &nbsp; <span class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 18pt; color: #500000;\"><strong class=\"\"><span class=\"\">Note</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>Keep the following in mind:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Attempts:</strong>&nbsp;You will have&nbsp;<strong>2 attempts</strong> for this quiz, with your highest score recorded in the gradebook.</li>\n<li><strong>Time Limit: </strong>You must complete each of your attempts in one sitting. You are allotted <strong>30&nbsp;</strong><strong>minutes per</strong>&nbsp;attempt.</li>\n<li>After you submit your attempt, you will be able to view the correct answers.</li>\n<li><strong>Assigned Text: </strong>Course Syllabus</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>To start, click the&nbsp;\u201cBegin\u201d&nbsp;button. When finished, click the&nbsp;\u201cSubmit Quiz\u201d&nbsp;button.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"cp-bg-warning dp-border-dir-tblr dp-border-style-solid\" style=\"background-color: #f7f7f7; color: #000000; border-left-color: #003c71; border-width: 0px 4px; border-right-color: #003c71;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #500000;\"><strong style=\"background-color: #f7f7f7;\"><i class=\"fas fa-thumbs-up\"><span class=\"dp-icon-content\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></i> Good Luck!</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong><em>Click Next (below) to progress through the course.</em></strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"width: 100%; min-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/prod.files.ciditools.com/tamu/Banners_Footer/Banners_Footer/Footer.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n</div>",
